{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2006-reserva-4","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2006,"convocatoria":"Reserva 4","documento":"MAT-2006-RESERVA_4.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2006-reserva-4-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"","apartados":["(1,5 p.) Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función dada por \\(f(x)=ax^2+b\\). Halla los valores de \\(a\\) y \\(b\\) sabiendo que \\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^6f(x)\\,dx=6\\) y que la pendiente de la recta tangente a la gráfica de la función \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa 3 vale \\(-12\\).","(1 p.) Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función dada por \\(f(x)=x^2+px+q\\). Calcula los valores de \\(p\\) y \\(q\\) sabiendo que la función \\(f\\) tiene un extremo en \\(x=-6\\) y su valor en él es \\(-2\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[\\int_0^6(ax^2+b)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{ax^3}3+bx\\Bigr]_0^6=72a+6b=6\\iff12a+b=1\\]<p>\\(f'(x)=2ax\\), y \\(f'(3)=6a=-12\\iff a=-2\\). Entonces \\(b=1+24=25\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=-2\\), \\(b=25\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es derivable: en un extremo \\(f'=0\\). \\(f'(x)=2x+p\\), \\(f'(-6)=-12+p=0\\iff p=12\\). Y \\(f(-6)=36-72+q=-2\\iff q=34\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(p=12\\), \\(q=34\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"def","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"mono","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2006-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2006-reserva-4-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Calcula \\(\\displaystyle\\int(x^2-1)e^{-x}\\,dx\\)","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Por partes dos veces<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i>:</p>\\[u=x^2-1,\\ dv=e^{-x}dx:\\quad\\int(x^2-1)e^{-x}dx=-(x^2-1)e^{-x}+\\int2xe^{-x}dx\\]\\[u=2x,\\ dv=e^{-x}dx:\\quad\\int2xe^{-x}dx=-2xe^{-x}+\\int2e^{-x}dx=-2xe^{-x}-2e^{-x}\\]\\[\\int(x^2-1)e^{-x}dx=-e^{-x}(x^2-1+2x+2)+C=-(x+1)^2e^{-x}+C\\]<div class='res'>\\(-(x+1)^2e^{-x}+C\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"part","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2006-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2006-reserva-4-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&-1\\\\0&m-3&3\\\\m+1&2&0\\end{pmatrix}\\)","apartados":["(1 p.) Determina los valores de \\(m\\in\\mathbb R\\) para los que la matriz \\(A\\) tiene inversa.","(1,5 p.) Para \\(m=0\\) y siendo \\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}x&y&z\\end{pmatrix}\\), resuelve \\(XA=\\begin{pmatrix}3&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Tiene inversa si \\(|A|\\neq0\\). Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&-1\\\\0&m-3&3\\\\m+1&2&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+3 m + 3+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(- m^{2} + 2 m + 3+6+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=m^2+m-6=(m-2)(m+3)\\]<div class='res'>\\(A\\) tiene inversa para \\(m\\neq2\\) y \\(m\\neq-3\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(m=0\\), \\(A\\) es invertible (\\(|A|=-6\\)) y \\(X=(3\\ 1\\ 1)A^{-1}\\):</p><p>Como \\(|A|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A=\\begin{pmatrix}-6 & 3 & 3\\\\-2 & 1 & -1\\\\0 & -3 & -3\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow A^{-1}=-\\frac1{6}\\begin{pmatrix}-6 & -2 & 0\\\\3 & 1 & -3\\\\3 & -1 & -3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0\\\\- \\frac{1}{2} & - \\frac{1}{6} & \\frac{1}{2}\\\\- \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{6} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=-\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}3&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-6 & -2 & 0\\\\3 & 1 & -3\\\\3 & -1 & -3\\end{pmatrix}=-\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}-12 & -6 & -6\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}2&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\), es decir, \\(x=2,\\ y=1,\\ z=1\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":"a, b"},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ecmat","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2006-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2006-reserva-4-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(r\\) la recta de ecuación \\(\\dfrac{x-5}2=\\dfrac{y+2}{-1}=\\dfrac z4\\) y \\(s\\) la recta dada por \\(\\begin{cases}3x-2y+z=2\\\\-x+2y-3z=2\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":["(1,5 p.) Determina la posición relativa de ambas rectas.","(1 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano que contiene a la recta \\(r\\) y es paralelo a la recta \\(s\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\): \\(R(5,-2,0)\\), \\(\\vec u=(2,-1,4)\\). \\(s\\): director \\((3,-2,1)\\times(-1,2,-3)=(4,8,4)\\parallel\\vec v=(1,2,1)\\); con \\(z=0\\): \\(3x-2y=2\\), \\(-x+2y=2\\Rightarrow x=2,\\ y=2\\): \\(S(2,2,0)\\).</p><p>Los directores no son proporcionales: se cortan o se cruzan. Con \\(\\overrightarrow{RS}=(-3,4,0)\\), por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec u,\\vec v]=\\begin{vmatrix}-3&4&0\\\\2&-1&4\\\\1&2&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(3+16+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0-24+8\\bigr)\\]\\[=35\\neq0\\]<div class='res'>\\(r\\) y \\(s\\) se cruzan</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[\\vec n=\\vec u\\times\\vec v=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\2&-1&4\\\\1&2&1\\end{vmatrix}=(-9,\\,2,\\,5)\\parallel(9,-2,-5)\\]<p>Plano \\(9x-2y-5z+D=0\\) por \\(R\\): \\(45+4+D=0\\iff D=-49\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":165,\"el\":26,\"p\":[[\"line\",[3.0,-1.0,-4.0],[7.0,-3.0,4.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[7.0,-3.0,4.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.8,-0.4,-1.2],[3.2,4.4,1.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.2,4.4,1.2],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"poly\",[[7.929,0.083,4.44],[7.124,-3.54,4.44],[4.541,-2.966,-0.44],[5.346,0.657,-0.44]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",