\\) tales que \\(|A-\\lambda I|=0\\).","(1,25 p.) Calcula \\(A^2-7A+10I\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[|A-\\lambda I|=\\begin{vmatrix}4-\\lambda&2\\\\1&3-\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}=(4-\\lambda)(3-\\lambda)-2=\\lambda^2-7\\lambda+10=0\\iff\\lambda=2\\ \\text{ o }\\ \\lambda=5\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\lambda=2\\) y \\(\\lambda=5\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[A^2=\\begin{pmatrix}18 & 14\\\\7 & 11\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad A^2-7A+10I=\\begin{pmatrix}18 & 14\\\\7 & 11\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}28 & 14\\\\7 & 21\\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix}10 & 0\\\\0 & 10\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0\\\\0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(A^2-7A+10I=O\\) (la matriz nula)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Es el mismo polinomio del apartado a), \\(\\lambda^2-7\\lambda+10\\), evaluado en la matriz.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"det","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ops","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2006-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2006-reserva-4-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera la recta \\(r\\) de ecuaciones \\(\\begin{cases}x+y+z=1\\\\x-2y+3z=0\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Determina la ecuación del plano que contiene a la recta \\(r\\) y no corta al eje \\(OZ\\).","(1,25 p.) Calcula la proyección ortogonal del punto \\(A(1,2,1)\\) sobre la recta \\(r\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Director de \\(r\\): \\((1,1,1)\\times(1,-2,3)=(5,-2,-3)\\). Con \\(z=0\\): \\(x+y=1\\), \\(x-2y=0\\Rightarrow R\\left(\\frac23,\\frac13,0\\right)\\). Así \\(r\\equiv\\left(\\frac23+5t,\\ \\frac13-2t,\\ -3t\\right)\\).</p><p>Para no cortar al eje \\(OZ\\), el plano debe ser paralelo a él: contiene a \\(\\vec d=(5,-2,-3)\\) y a \\(\\vec k=(0,0,1)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d\\times\\vec k=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\5&-2&-3\\\\0&0&1\\end{vmatrix}=(-2,\\,-5,\\,0)\\parallel(2,5,0)\\]<p>Plano \\(2x+5y+D=0\\) por \\(R\\): \\(\\frac43+\\frac53+D=0\\iff D=-3\\). No contiene al eje: \\((0,0,z)\\) da \\(-3\\neq0\\) ✓.</p><div class='res'>\\(2x+5y-3=0\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Plano perpendicular a </b>\\(r\\)<b> por </b>\\(A\\)<b>:</b> \\(5x-2y-3z+D=0\\), con \\(5-4-3+D=0\\iff D=2\\). <b>Corte con </b>\\(r\\)<b>:</b></p>\\[5\\left(\\tfrac23+5t\\right)-2\\left(\\tfrac13-2t\\right)-3(-3t)+2=0\\iff38t+\\frac{14}3=0\\iff t=-\\frac7{57}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-57,\"el\":52,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-0.583,0.833,0.75],[1.917,-0.167,-0.75],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.917,-0.167,-0.75],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[1,2,1],[0.053,0.579,0.368],\"#e11d48\",1.6,false],[\"pt\",[1,2,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0.053,0.579,0.368],\"M\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m06r4b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m06r4b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m06r4b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m06r4b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='26.0' y1='37.3' x2='147.9' y2='246.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='153.9' y='246.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='180.2' y1='18.0' x2='57.0' y2='90.4' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='180.2' cy='18.